# US SWS pipeline — what NOT to commit.
#
# The raw API payloads and parsed deep briefs are large (~5.4k files). In prod
# the per-stock modal is served from a committed, compressed deep-us.tar.gz
# (lazy per-ticker extract), mirroring the India deep.tar.gz pattern — so the
# loose dirs are never committed.
deep/
deep-api/

# Transient build / run artifacts.
universe-from-sitemap.json
*.tmp.*
progress-api-*.json
active-shards.lock
scan-*.lock
pipeline.lock
pipeline-status.json
panic-stop.flag
captures/
failed.json
refresh-requested.json
news-progress*.json
news-latest.json
news-latest-*.json
news-shard-*.log

# Committed (NOT ignored): universe.json, picks-latest.json,
# sws-scored-universe.json, v3-universe-stats.json, last-refresh.json,
# deep-us.tar.gz
